license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  Semi-automated screening pipeline developed to support systematic
  mapping studies involving serious games, artificial intelligence,
  Internet of Things technologies, and health applications. The
  pipeline includes database-specific metadata import, metadata
  standardization, duplicate detection, master dataset management,
  LLM-assisted evidence classification, deterministic screening rules,
  safety-rescue mechanisms, checkpoint-based execution, and routing
  of uncertain records for human review.

